1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:20,579
[Host] Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is July twenty-fourth. Today's story is from the world of football. The Japan Football Association has chosen Go Oiwa as the next manager of the national team, with an unusual half-year handover plan. Let's listen.

2
00:00:21,179 --> 00:00:24,132
